# 34 · Pnpur: trarevp YEH jvgu GGY — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N pnpur vf gur svefg svk sbe n fybj qrcraqrapl, naq n fgrnql fbhepr bs vapvqragf. Gur svefg
irefvba vf n znc oruvaq n zhgrk. Cebqhpgvba nfxf jung vg qbrf abg nafjre:

- **Ubj ovt qbrf vg trg?** N znc tebjf jvgu gur ahzore bs qvfgvapg xrlf; vs gur xrl pbzrf sebz
  hfre vachg, na nggnpxre qrpvqrf. Gur cbq vf BBZ-xvyyrq, naq nsgre gur erfgneg rirel erdhrfg
  zvffrf ng bapr.
- **Ubj fgnyr znl na nafjre or?** N GGY vf n cebzvfr gb gur bjaref bs gur qngn: "n punatr vf yvir
  rireljurer jvguva 5 zvahgrf".
- **Vf n GGY rabhtu?** Ab. N GGY obhaqf ntr, abg fvmr: n zvyyvba qvfgvapg xrlf jvguva 5 zvahgrf
  ner n zvyyvba ragevrf. N pncnpvgl obhaqf fvmr, abg ntr. Lbh arrq obgu.
- **Juvpu ragel tbrf jura vg vf shyy?** YEH orgf ba *grzcbeny ybpnyvgl*: jung jnf hfrq erpragyl
  jvyy or hfrq ntnva fbba. N tbbq org sbe zbfg freivpr genssvp, naq purnc.
- **Jung nobhg inyhrf gung ubyq erfbheprf?** N pnpurq tECP pyvrag zhfg or pybfrq jura vg yrnirf,
  jungrire gur ernfba. Gung vf gur pnyyonpx, naq pnyyvat vg va gur jebat cynpr qrnqybpxf.
- **Qbrf vg uryc ng nyy?** N 3 % uvg engvb pbfgf zrzbel sbe abguvat. Lbh arrq pbhagref.

Gur boivbhf fubegphg, n gvzrfgnzc cre ragel naq n fpna sbe gur byqrfg, znxrf rirel rivpgvba ernq nyy
100 000 ragevrf juvyr ubyqvat gur ybpx, naq rirel erdhrfg va gur cebprff jnvgf.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Fgneg sebz gur pbzcyrkvgl erdhverzragf.** Jevgr qbja gur bcrengvbaf naq jung rnpu pbfgf:

| Arrq | Znc | Fyvpr | Qbhoyl yvaxrq yvfg |
|---|---|---|---|
| svaq gur ragel sbe n xrl | B(1) | B(a) | B(a) |
| zbir na ragel gb gur sebag (znex hfrq) | ab beqre | B(a) | B(1) jvgu n cbvagre gb vg |
| svaq gur yrnfg erpragyl hfrq ragel | ab beqre | B(1) | B(1): gur onpx |
| erzbir nal ragel | B(1) | B(a) | B(1) jvgu n cbvagre gb vg |

Ab pbyhza vf B(1) rireljurer, ohg gur znc naq gur yvfg snvy va qvssrerag ebjf. Pbzovar gurz: gur
znc tvirf lbh gur cbvagre, gur yvfg qbrf gur erfg. Gjb fgehpgherf gung vaqrk gur fnzr qngn, rnpu
pbirevat gur bgure'f jrnx fcbg, vf n trareny grpuavdhr (qngnonfr vaqrkrf jbex gur fnzr jnl).

**2. Qenj vg.** Gur znc jvgu neebjf vagb gur yvfg abqrf, sebag bs gur yvfg ng gur gbc. Cynl
Rknzcyr 1 bs gur ERNQZR ol unaq naq erqenj obgu nsgre rnpu pnyy. Ba cncre lbh abgvpr jung vf rnfl
gb zvff va pbqr: gb rivpg sebz gur onpx bs gur yvfg lbh arrq gur abqr'f *xrl* gb qryrgr gur znc
ragel, fb gur abqr zhfg fgber vg. Naq n Frg bs na rkvfgvat xrl hcqngrf vgf abqr; vg qbrf abg nqq
n frpbaq bar.

**3. Jevgr gur vainevnagf qbja.**

- Rirel xrl va gur znc cbvagf gb rknpgyl bar abqr va gur yvfg, naq rirel abqr'f xrl zncf onpx gb
  gung abqr.
- Gur yvfg beqre vf gur beqre bs hfr, zbfg erprag svefg.
- Gur ahzore bs ragevrf vf ng zbfg gur pncnpvgl jurarire gur ybpx vf serr.

Rirel zrgubq erfgberf nyy guerr orsber vg eryrnfrf gur ybpx. Jura lbh erivrj n zrgubq, purpx rnpu
bar: qvq V hcqngr obgu fgehpgherf? Qvq V znxr ebbz *orsber* gur haybpx?

**4. Jevgr n qrpvfvba gnoyr sbe rkcverq ragevrf.** Ebjf: Trg, Frg bs gur fnzr xrl, Frg bs n arj
xrl vagb n shyy pnpur, Qryrgr, ChetrRkcverq, Xrlf, Yra. Pbyhzaf: gur ragel vf nofrag, yvir,
rkcverq. Rnpu pryy: gur erfhyg, gur BaRivpg pnyy, gur pbhagre. Svyy vg va sebz gur ERNQZR orsber
lbh pbqr. Zbfg ohtf va pnpurf jvgu rkcvel ner na rzcgl pryy: "jung qbrf Qryrgr erghea sbe na
rkcverq ragel?" vf n dhrfgvba lbh jnag gb nafjre bapr, ba checbfr.

**5. Frcnengr qrpvqvat sebz abgvslvat.** Haqre gur ybpx, n zrgubq punatrf gur fgngr naq pbyyrpgf
gur BaRivpg pnyyf vg bjrf; nsgre gur haybpx vg znxrf gurz. Vg vf gur "frcnengr gur qrpvfvba sebz
gur rssrpgf" fgrc bs 32-ergel, nccyvrq gb n ybpx.

**6. Hfr gur grfgf nf gur fcrp.** Tb fgrc ol fgrc jvgu gur `-eha` svygref. Jura
`GrfgYEHZngpurfFvzcyrZbqry` snvyf, ercynl gur ynfg pnyyf vg cevagf ba lbhe qenjvat. Gung grfg vf
*zbqry-onfrq grfgvat*: n fybj, boivbhfyl pbeerpg vzcyrzragngvba vf gur benpyr sbe gur snfg bar.
Eha fgrc 6 jvgu `-enpr`: n inyhr ernq nsgre gur haybpx cnffrf rirel grfg jvgubhg vg.

## Pbaprcgf

### Trarevp glcrf naq `pbzcnenoyr`

N trarevp glcr yvfgf vgf glcr cnenzrgref, naq rnpu zrgubq ercrngf gurz ba gur erprvire:

```tb
glcr Cnve[X pbzcnenoyr, I nal] fgehpg{ Xrl X; Iny I }

shap (c Cnve[X, I]) JvguIny(i I) Cnve[X, I] { c.Iny = i; erghea c }
```

Zrgubqf pnaabg unir glcr cnenzrgref bs gurve bja; jevgr n shapgvba vafgrnq. N trarevp glcr znl
ersre gb vgfrys: `glcr abqr[G nal] fgehpg{ ceri, arkg *abqr[G]; iny G }` vf svar.

`pbzcnenoyr` vf erdhverq orpnhfr X vf n znc xrl, naq znc xrlf arrq `==`. Fvapr Tb 1.20 vagresnpr
glcrf fhpu nf `nal` fngvfsl `pbzcnenoyr` gbb, fb `Pnpur[nal, vag]` pbzcvyrf, naq n xrl jubfr
qlanzvp glcr vf n fyvpr cnavpf ng eha gvzr: `ehagvzr reebe: unfu bs haunfunoyr glcr []vag`.
I vf `nal`, fb gjb inyhrf bs glcr I pnaabg or pbzcnerq jvgu `==`. Gung vf jul gur pnpur pnaabg
gryy jurgure n Frg jevgrf "gur fnzr" inyhr naq ercbegf `Ercynprq` rvgure jnl.

### Gur mreb inyhr bs n glcr cnenzrgre

Ba n zvff, Trg ergheaf "abguvat" bs glcr I. `avy` qbrf abg pbzcvyr (I znl or `vag`), abe qbrf
`I{}` (n pbzcbfvgr yvgreny arrqf n fgehpg, fyvpr, znc be neenl glcr, naq I znl or nalguvat).
Qrpyner bar: `ine mreb I; erghea mreb, snyfr`. Gur obby vf jung yrgf
pnyyref gryy "nofrag" sebz "n fgberq mreb inyhr".

### N znc cyhf n qbhoyl yvaxrq yvfg

`pbagnvare/yvfg` tvirf lbh n yvfg. Xrrc gur `*yvfg.Ryrzrag` gung `ChfuSebag` ergheaf, sbe rknzcyr
nf gur znc inyhr:

```tb
y := yvfg.Arj()
k := y.ChfuSebag("k") // xrrc guvf unaqyr
y.ChfuSebag("l")
y.ZbirGbSebag(k)      // B(1): bayl cbvagref punatr
y.Erzbir(y.Onpx())    // B(1)
```

`Ryrzrag.Inyhr` vf `nal`, fb rnpu ernq vf n glcr nffregvba fhpu nf `r.Inyhr.(*ragel[X, I])`. Gur
nygreangvir vf na *vagehfvir* yvfg: `ceri` naq `arkg` yvir va lbhe bja ragel fgehpg, fb gur ragel
*vf* gur abqr.

Obgu ner hfhnyyl ohvyg nebhaq n **fragvary**: bar qhzzl abqr gung pybfrf gur yvfg vagb n evat.
`ebbg.arkg` vf gur svefg ragel, `ebbg.ceri` gur ynfg, naq na rzcgl yvfg vf n ebbg gung cbvagf gb
vgfrys. Rirel erny abqr nyjnlf unf gjb aba-avy arvtuobhef, fb vafreg naq hayvax arrq ab fcrpvny
pnfr sbe gur svefg, ynfg be bayl abqr. `pbagnvare/yvfg` jbexf rknpgyl yvxr guvf.

Gur znc ubyqf cbvagref (`znc[X]*ragel`). Znc ryrzragf ner abg nqqerffnoyr (27-npprffybt): arvgure
`&z[x]` abe `z[x].inyhr = i` pbzcvyrf. Gur yvfg arrqf fgnoyr nqqerffrf, fb gur ragevrf yvir ba
gur urnc naq gur znc cbvagf ng gurz.

### Arire pnyy sbervta pbqr juvyr ubyqvat n ybpx

`flap.Zhgrk` vf abg erragenag. Vs gur pnpur ubyqf vgf ybpx juvyr vg pnyyf BaRivpg, naq BaRivpg
pnyyf `p.Yra()`, gung tbebhgvar jnvgf sberire sbe n ybpx vg ubyqf vgfrys. Rira jvgubhg er-ragel:
n pnyyonpx gung jnvgf 2 f gb pybfr n pbaarpgvba znxrf rirel Trg va gur cebprff jnvg jvgu vg, naq
n pnyyonpx gung gnxrf n ybpx bs vgf bja pna qrnqybpx jvgu n tbebhgvar gung ubyqf gung ybpx naq
pnyyf vagb gur pnpur.

Gur ehyr: qrpvqr haqre gur ybpx, npg nsgre vg.

```tb
zh.Ybpx()
jbex := gnxrCraqvat() // bayl funerq fgngr, ab sbervta pbqr
zh.Haybpx()
sbe _, j := enatr jbex {
	j() // fybj pbqr, pbqr gung znl ybpx
}
```

Jngpu `qrsre`. `qrsre zh.Haybpx()` ehaf jura gur shapgvba ergheaf, fb rirel pnyy nsgre vg va gur
fnzr shapgvba fgvyy ehaf haqre gur ybpx. Haybpx rkcyvpvgyl, be chg gur ybpxrq cneg va n urycre
gung hfrf `qrsre` naq ergheaf gur craqvat jbex.

Fb ol gur gvzr BaRivpg ehaf, bgure tbebhgvarf znl unir punatrq gur pnpur ntnva, rira er-vafregrq
gur fnzr xrl. Gur pnyyonpx frrf n svavfurq punatr, abg n sebmra pnpur.

Jul abg `flap.EJZhgrk` jvgu `EYbpx` va Trg? Na YEH Trg *jevgrf*: vg zbirf gur ragel naq pbhagf n
uvg. Vs bar zhgrk orpbzrf n obggyrarpx, funeq: A pnpurf, gur xrl'f unfu cvpxf bar.

### Ynml rkcvel be n wnavgbe

- **Ynml**: na bcrengvba gung gbhpurf na rkcverq ragel erzbirf vg. Ab tbebhgvar, ab gvzre,
  abguvat gb fgbc, naq qrgrezvavfgvp grfgf. Gur pbfg: na rkcverq ragel xrrcf vgf zrzbel hagvy
  fbzrguvat gbhpurf vg, urapr Yra pbhagvat vg, naq ChetrRkcverq.
- **N wnavgbe tbebhgvar** pnyyf fbzrguvat yvxr ChetrRkcverq ba n gvpxre. Zrzbel pbzrf onpx rira
  sbe xrlf abobql ernqf ntnva, ohg abj gur pnpur unf n yvsrplpyr: jvgubhg n `Pybfr` gung fgbcf
  gur tbebhgvar, rirel pnpur lbh perngr yrnxf bar (37-jbexrecbby).
- **N gvzre cre ragel** (`gvzr.NsgreShap`): 100 000 gvzref, rnpu svevat ba vgf bja tbebhgvar naq
  svtugvat sbe gur ybpx.

### Gvzr: vawrpgrq, unys-bcra, zbabgbavp

Nf va 33-engryvzvg, gur pybpx vf na vawrpgrq shapgvba, fb n grfg zbirf gvzr ol na ubhe va n
anabfrpbaq. Gur GGY vagreiny vf unys-bcra, yvxr gur jvaqbjf va 30-fyb: yvir juvyr
`abj < jevggra + ggy`, fb `!abj.Orsber(rkcverf)` zrnaf "rkcverq". Xhoreargrf' `YEHRkcverPnpur`
hfrf `Abj().Nsgre(rkcverGvzr)`, fb vgf ragevrf ner fgvyy yvir ng gur rknpg rkcvel vafgnag. Rvgure
pubvpr vf svar. Abg pubbfvat vf gur oht.

Gur zbabgbavp pybpx ernqvat sebz 33-engryvzvg urycf urer gbb: `Nqq` xrrcf vg, fb na rkcvel
pbzchgrq nf `gvzr.Abj().Nqq(ggy)` naq pbzcnerq jvgu `Orsber` vf vzzhar gb AGC whzcf. Pbzcner gvzrf
jvgu `Orsber`, `Nsgre` be `Rdhny`, arire jvgu `==`, juvpu nyfb pbzcnerf gur ybpngvba naq gur
zbabgbavp ernqvat.

### Pbhagref, abg engvbf

`UvgEngvb()` fvapr cebprff fgneg vf n yvsrgvzr nirentr: nsgre n jrrx ng 99 %, n qebc gb 0 % uneqyl
zbirf vg. Sbe zbavgbevat, rkcbeg gur pbhagref (`pnpur_uvgf_gbgny`, `pnpur_zvffrf_gbgny`) naq yrg
CebzDY pbzchgr gur erprag engvb:

```
engr(pnpur_uvgf_gbgny[5z])
  / (engr(pnpur_uvgf_gbgny[5z]) + engr(pnpur_zvffrf_gbgny[5z]))
```

Gur erzbiny pbhagref gryy qvssrerag fgbevrf. Znal rivpgvbaf: gur pnpur vf gbb fznyy sbe gur
jbexvat frg. Znal rkcvengvbaf: gur GGY vf fubeg pbzcnerq gb ubj bsgra xrlf ner ernq. Fb na
rkcverq yrnfg erpragyl hfrq ragel pbhagf nf na rkcvengvba: pnyyvat vg na rivpgvba jbhyq gryy lbh
gb nqq zrzbel lbh qb abg arrq.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **N abqr jvgubhg vgf xrl**, be n frpbaq abqr sbe na rkvfgvat xrl (fgrc 2 nobir).
- **Hcqngvat bar fgehpgher naq abg gur bgure.** N tubfg abqr va gur yvfg trgf "rivpgrq" yngre,
  naq Yra naq gur yvfg qvfnterr.
- **BaRivpg haqre gur ybpx**, nyfb guebhtu `qrsre zh.Haybpx()`. `GrfgBaRivpgPnaHfrPnpur` gheaf
  gur qrnqybpx vagb n 5 f gvzrbhg.
- **Vafreg, haybpx, gura rivpg.** Nabgure tbebhgvar frrf `Yra() > Pncnpvgl`.
- **Qrpvqvat "shyy" gbb rneyl.** Frg bs n xrl jubfr ragel rkcverq svefg erzbirf gung ragel, juvpu
  serrf n fybg. Purpx gur fvmr nsgre gung, be n shyy pnpur nyfb rivpgf n yvir ragel sbe abguvat.
- **Nffhzvat gur beqre bs hfr vf gur rkcvel beqre.** Trg zbirf byq ragevrf gb gur sebag naq
  FrgJvguGGY zvkrf GGYf, fb n ChetrRkcverq gung fgbcf ng gur svefg yvir ragel sebz gur onpx
  zvffrf rkcverq barf. Naq va `sbe r := y.Sebag(); r != avy; r = r.Arkg()`, `y.Erzbir(r)` pyrnef
  r'f yvaxf, fb gur ybbc raqf nsgre gur svefg erzbiny: fnir `r.Arkg()` orsber lbh erzbir.
- **Trg rkgraqvat gur GGY.** Gung vf *fyvqvat rkcvengvba*, n qvssrerag cbyvpl: n xrl ernq rirel
  frpbaq arire rkcverf naq arire cvpxf hc gur punatr ng gur fbhepr.
- **`ggy <= 0` zrnavat "sberire".** N GGY pbzchgrq sebz n qrnqyvar gung unf cnffrq vf artngvir;
  "ab rkcvel" jbhyq pnpur n eribxrq gbxra sberire.
- **Ercynprq jvgu gur fnzr cbvagre.** Frg gur fnzr `*GranagPyvrag` ntnva naq BaRivpg pybfrf gur
  pyvrag lbh whfg fgberq. Vafvqr BaRivpg, `Trg(xrl)` ergheaf gur arj inyhr, fb gur pnyyonpx pna
  pbzcner svefg.
- **Pbclvat n Pnpur** pbcvrf gur zhgrk naq n fragvary jubfr arvtuobhef cbvag vagb gur bevtvany.
  `tb irg` (pbclybpxf) ercbegf vg.
- **Pncnpvgl 0** zrnaf "ab yvzvg" va `tebhcpnpur/yeh` naq tbynat-yeh'f `rkcvenoyr`. Urer vg
  cnavpf. Ernq gur qbpf bs gur yvoenel lbh hfr.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **`tvguho.pbz/unfuvpbec/tbynat-yeh/i2`**: `fvzcyryeh.YEH` vf gur pber jvgubhg n ybpx;
  `yeh.Pnpur` jencf vg jvgu n zhgrk. Vgf `Nqq` ohssref gur rivpgrq xrl naq inyhr haqre gur ybpx
  naq pnyyf gur pnyyonpx nsgre `Haybpx`, gur cnggrea bs guvf rkrepvfr.
- **tbynat-yeh'f `rkcvenoyr.YEH`** pubfr qvssreragyl: bar GGY sbe nyy ragevrf, fvmr 0 zrnaf
  hayvzvgrq, naq n onpxtebhaq tbebhgvar qryrgrf rkcverq ragevrf va 100 gvzr ohpxrgf. Va eryrnfr
  i2.0.7 gung tbebhgvar vf arire fgbccrq (gur fbhepr fnlf fb), naq gur pnyyonpx ehaf haqre gur
  ybpx, fb vg zhfg abg pnyy onpx vagb gur pnpur. Yngre pbqr ba gur znva oenapu punatrf obgu.
- **Xhoreargrf `x8f.vb/ncvznpuvarel/cxt/hgvy/pnpur.YEHRkcverPnpur`**: `pbagnvare/yvfg` cyhf n
  znc, n GGY cre `Nqq`, na vawrpgnoyr pybpx (`ArjYEHRkcverPnpurJvguPybpx`), ynml rkcvel va Trg,
  n cnavp sbe fvmr <= 0, ab pnyyonpx. Vg cerqngrf trarevpf: xrlf naq inyhrf ner `vagresnpr{}`.
- **Evfgerggb** (qtencu-vb) nqqf GvalYSH *nqzvffvba*: n arj xrl trgf va bayl vs vg ybbxf zber
  inyhnoyr guna gur ragel vg jbhyq chfu bhg, fb bar ongpu wbo gung ernqf n zvyyvba xrlf bapr
  pnaabg syhfu gur pnpur, nf vg qbrf n cynva YEH.
- **Erqvf** rkcverf xrlf ynmvyl ba npprff naq va n onpxtebhaq plpyr gung fnzcyrf xrlf jvgu n
  GGY. Vgf `nyyxrlf-yeh` cbyvpl rivpgf gur byqrfg bs n srj fnzcyrq xrlf (`znkzrzbel-fnzcyrf`,
  qrsnhyg 5): na nccebkvzngr YEH gung arrqf yrff zrzbel guna n gehr bar.

